usage: build-cc-j4.py [-h] --source SOURCE --commit COMMIT [--patch PATCH]
                      [--extra-target EXTRA_TARGET] [--cmake-define KEY=VALUE]
                      [--linkage] [--linkage-optional] --tag TAG --out OUT

Build a local CUDA engine and record evidence; uses only the Python stdlib.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --source SOURCE
  --commit COMMIT
  --patch PATCH
  --extra-target EXTRA_TARGET
                        extra CMake executable target to build and ship in
                        /app (e.g. llama-routing-trace added by a patch)
  --cmake-define KEY=VALUE
                        additional CMake definition (repeatable; built-in
                        flags cannot be overridden)
  --linkage             check dynamic cudart linkage and CUDA imports after
                        building; failures are fatal
  --linkage-optional    enable linkage check but allow failed/unavailable
                        checks
  --tag TAG
  --out OUT
